{"task_id": "Mbpp/9", "solution": "def find_Rotations(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the minimum number of rotations (greater than 0) required to get the same string.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(s)\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0  # Or handle as per specific requirement for empty string\n\n    # Concatenate the string with itself to easily check all rotations\n    temp = s + s\n\n    for k in range(1, n + 1):\n        rotated_s = temp[k : k + n]\n        if rotated_s == s:\n            return k\n    return n # Should only be reached if no smaller rotation returns the original string (e.g., \"abc\")"}
