{"task_id": "Mbpp/12", "solution": "def sort_matrix(matrix: list[list[int]]) -> list[list[int]]:\n    # Pair each row with its sum.\n    row_sums = []\n    for row in matrix:\n        row_sums.append((sum(row), row))\n\n    # Sort the pairs based on the row sums in ascending order.\n    row_sums.sort(key=lambda x: x[0])\n\n    # Extract the original rows from the sorted pairs.\n    sorted_matrix = [row for _, row in row_sums]\n    return sorted_matrix"}
