{"task_id": "Mbpp/69", "solution": "def is_sublist(main_list: list, sub_list: list) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if sub_list is contained contiguously and in order within main_list.\n    Returns True if sub_list is found, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not sub_list:\n        return True\n\n    if len(sub_list) > len(main_list):\n        return False\n\n    n = len(main_list)\n    m = len(sub_list)\n    for i in range(n - m + 1):\n        if main_list[i:i+m] == sub_list:\n            return True\n    return False"}
