{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "import math\ndef _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Computes the binomial coefficient C(n, k).\"\"\"\n    return math.factorial(n) // (math.factorial(k) * math.factorial(n - k))\ndef even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even index binomial coefficients for a given positive integer n.\n    Raises ValueError if n is not a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int) or n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be a positive integer.\")\n\n    current_sum = 0\n    for k in range(0, n + 1):\n        if k % 2 == 0:\n            current_sum += _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n    return current_sum"}
