{"task_id": "Mbpp/283", "solution": "def validate(integer: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the frequency of each digit in the integer is less than or equal to the digit itself.\n    It delegates to helper functions to perform digit frequency calculation and condition checks.\"\"\"\n\n    def _get_digit_frequencies(number: int) -> dict[int, int]:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the frequency of each digit in the given number.\"\"\"\n        frequencies = {}\n        s_number = str(number)\n        for char_digit in s_number:\n            digit = int(char_digit)\n            frequencies[digit] = frequencies.get(digit, 0) + 1\n        return frequencies\n\n    def _check_frequency_condition(digit: int, frequency: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if the frequency of a digit is less than or equal to the digit's value.\"\"\"\n        return frequency <= digit\n\n    digit_frequencies = _get_digit_frequencies(integer)\n\n    for digit, frequency in digit_frequencies.items():\n        if not _check_frequency_condition(digit, frequency):\n            return False\n    return True"}
