{"task_id": "Mbpp/409", "solution": "def min_product_tuple(tuple_list: list[tuple[int, int]]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Finds the minimum product from a list of integer tuples.\n\n    Returns float('inf') if the input list is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not tuple_list:\n        return float('inf')\n\n    products = []\n    for t in tuple_list:\n        product = t[0] * t[1]\n        products.append(product)\n\n    min_prod = min(products)\n    return min_prod"}
