{"task_id": "Mbpp/419", "solution": "class Number:\n    \"\"\"Encapsulates a single numeric value and provides functionality to round itself.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, value: float):\n        \"\"\"Initializes a Number object with an original value and immediately rounds it.\"\"\"\n        self._original_value: float = value\n        self._rounded_value: int = round(value)\n\n    def get_rounded_value(self) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Returns the rounded integer value.\"\"\"\n        return self._rounded_value\nclass NumberList:\n    \"\"\"Manages a collection of Number objects, orchestrates their rounding, and computes\n    the sum of rounded values, the count, and the final product.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, values: list[float]):\n        \"\"\"Initializes the list with float values, creating Number objects.\"\"\"\n        self._numbers: list[Number] = [Number(v) for v in values]\n        self._sum_of_rounded_numbers: float = 0.0\n        self._count_of_numbers: int = 0\n        self._final_product: float = 0.0\n\n    def process_numbers(self) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Iterates through numbers, calculates sum of rounded values, count, and final product.\"\"\"\n        self._sum_of_rounded_numbers = 0.0\n        self._count_of_numbers = len(self._numbers)\n\n        for num_obj in self._numbers:\n            self._sum_of_rounded_numbers += num_obj.get_rounded_value()\n\n        self._final_product = self._sum_of_rounded_numbers * self._count_of_numbers\n\n    def get_final_product(self) -> float:\n        \"\"\"Returns the calculated final product.\"\"\"\n        return self._final_product\ndef round_and_sum(numbers: list[float]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Rounds every number of a given list of numbers and returns the total sum\n    multiplied by the length of the list.\n    \"\"\"\n    number_list_processor = NumberList(numbers)\n    number_list_processor.process_numbers()\n    return number_list_processor.get_final_product()"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n: int) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the average of the cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n    Returns the calculated average as a floating-point number.\"\"\"\n    sum_of_cubes = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        sum_of_cubes += i * i * i\n\n    average = float(sum_of_cubes) / n\n    return average"}
