{"task_id": "Mbpp/476", "solution": "def big_sum(array):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the sum of the largest and smallest value in a given array.\n    Assumes the input array will always contain at least one numerical element.\n    \"\"\"\n    largest_value = max(array)\n    smallest_value = min(array)\n    return largest_value + smallest_value"}
