{"task_id": "Mbpp/566", "solution": "def sum_digits(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the digits of a non-negative integer.\"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    # Process each digit by repeatedly taking the modulo and dividing by 10.\n    while number > 0:\n        total_sum += number % 10\n        number //= 10\n    return total_sum"}
