{"task_id": "Mbpp/593", "solution": "def removezero_ip(ipAddress: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Removes leading zeros from each octet of an IP address string.\n\n    The function splits the IP by dots, converts each octet to an integer to remove leading zeros, then converts it back to a string and rejoins.\n    \"\"\"\n    octets = ipAddress.split('.')\n    cleaned_octets = []\n    for octet in octets:\n        cleaned_octets.append(str(int(octet)))\n    return '.'.join(cleaned_octets)"}
