{"task_id": "Mbpp/743", "solution": "def rotate_right(input_list: list, count: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Rotates a list to the right by a specified number of items.\n\n    Returns a new list with elements rotated to the right.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_list:\n        return []\n\n    n = len(input_list)\n    effective_count = count % n\n\n    rotated_list = input_list[n - effective_count:] + input_list[:n - effective_count]\n    return rotated_list"}
