{"task_id": "Mbpp/758", "solution": "def unique_sublists(input_list: list) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts occurrences of sublists within a list, returning a dictionary\n    with tuple representations of sublists as keys and their counts as values.\n    \"\"\"\n    counts_dict = {}\n    for item in input_list:\n        if isinstance(item, list):\n            sublist_tuple = tuple(item)\n            counts_dict[sublist_tuple] = counts_dict.get(sublist_tuple, 0) + 1\n    return counts_dict"}
