{"task_id": "Mbpp/797", "solution": "def sum_in_range(l: int, r: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all odd natural numbers within the inclusive range [l, r].\n    Natural numbers are positive integers (>= 1).\n    \"\"\"\n    if l > r:\n        return 0\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    # Start iteration from the maximum of 1 and l, to ensure natural numbers and the lower bound.\n    start_num = max(1, l)\n\n    for num in range(start_num, r + 1):\n        # Check if the number is odd.\n        if num % 2 != 0:\n            total_sum += num\n\n    return total_sum"}
