{"task_id": "Mbpp/803", "solution": "def is_perfect_square(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given integer is a perfect square.\n    Handles non-negative integers.\n    \"\"\"\n    if number < 0:\n        return False\n    if number == 0:\n        return True\n\n    root = int(number**0.5)\n    return root * root == number"}
