{"task_id": "Mbpp/809", "solution": "def check_smaller(tuple1: tuple, tuple2: tuple) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if each element of the second tuple is smaller than its corresponding element in the first tuple.\n    Returns False if the second tuple is longer than the first.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(tuple2) > len(tuple1):\n        return False\n\n    for i in range(len(tuple2)):\n        if tuple2[i] >= tuple1[i]:\n            return False\n\n    return True"}
